        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: WWF The Music, Vol. 5\n- Organizations: WWE, World Wrestling Federation, Koch Records\n- People: Jim Johnston\n- Bands: Motörhead\n\nFacts:\n- Jim Johnston is an American music composer born in 1959.\n- Jim Johnston became best known for his work with WWE, formerly the World Wrestling Federation, from 1985 onward.\n- WWF The Music, Vol. 5 is a soundtrack album by WWE, then known as the World Wrestling Federation.\n- Koch Records released WWF The Music, Vol. 5 on February 20, 2001.\n- WWF The Music, Vol. 5 features entrance theme music for various WWE superstars.\n- Jim Johnston composed and performed the music on WWF The Music, Vol. 5 except for one song performed by Motörhead.",
